	(text "Pins 19 & 33 (AVDD33): Connect directly to the 3.3V plane\n (with standard 0.1µF decoupling caps next to them).\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPin 15 (AVDD33_PLL): DO NOT connect directly to the 3.3V plane.\n Route the 3.3V plane through the 33Ω ferrite bead,\n then to the 0.1µF + 22µF capacitors to GND, and then into Pin 15."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.346 164.338 0)
		(effects
